OL,3,GNEWSARenovation to begin for historical
OL,4,Apublic toilets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA listed building which currently
OL,7,Fserves as a Surrey village's public
OL,8,Ftoilets is to be renovated after
OL,9,Freceiving a #30,000 government grant.
OL,11,FThe Grade II-listed Old Fire Station in
OL,12,FShere was built in 1885 for the Shere
OL,13,Fand Albury volunteer fire brigade.
OL,15,FIt was converted into toilets in 1977,
OL,16,Fbut the facilities are "showing their
OL,17,Fage and are too small for the number of
OL,18,Fvisitors", according to Surrey Hills
OL,19,FNational Landscape.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
