OL,3,GNEWSARenovation to begin for historical
OL,4,Apublic toilets
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "The planned
OL,7,Fimprovements will provide better
OL,8,Ffacilities while retaining the
OL,9,Fcharacter of a building that forms part
OL,10,Fof Shere's distinctive heritage."
